tely, socially and outwardly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, deep down inside, she does not and cannot trust other people at all."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She was born a bastard and never knew her father's face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a strong affection for her mother and still takes pity on her, as she is unable to forget the man who fathered him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loves reading and enjoys writing poetry herself."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16513"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が獲物として目を付けた３年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が過去に調教した女が産んだ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"私生児として生まれたため、父親の顔は知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛想はいいが、内心では他人を全く信用しておらず、また信用することもできない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親に強い愛情を持っており、いまだに自分の父親である男のことを忘れられないでいる彼女のことを不憫に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"故に、母をそんな人間にした父親を憎んでおり、彼女ときちんと向き合って欲しいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"読書好きな図書委員、文芸部員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"詩を書くのが趣味。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5691","sourceWorkId":"17251","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"三年生。 文芸部に所属し、図書委員会にも入っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"公私ともに優良な学生で、人付き合いもよくて外面がよい。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、内心では他人を全く信用しておらず、また信用することが出来ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"私生児として生まれ、父親の顔を知らない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"母親に強い愛情を持っており、未だに自分の父親となっている男のことを忘れられないでいる彼女のことを不憫に思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"読書好きで、自分でも詩を書いたりするのが趣味。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63712"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5691","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"e","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5691","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"164 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5691","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"87 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5691","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"59 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5691","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"体重（本版本）","value":"54 kg","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5691","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c7944f54dbe3a4b3825537b327345b70ad9c822a9d6567b56a68fa0650e75615.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bc2e555638e0524f727d6fad5b236fbc8d3368274728811e836546514fff4c3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"高村優里","creatorId":"vndb:s354","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s354","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s354","name":"高村 優里","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:90791:63712:13512:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c16514","characterName":"辻井 ありさ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"63713","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"90791"}],"egsCharacterIds":["5692"],"vndbCharacterId":"c16514"},"originalCharacterName":"辻井 ありさ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"74"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"77"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"47"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A first-year student who is chasing after Saki."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and Saki have been childhood friends since elementary school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although they are seen as good friends by others, in reality, Arisa is just following her around one-sidedly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She admires her feminine proportions and personality, and she adores her from the bottom of his heart."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"sHe is also a black hearted person, and her interests are mostly focused on Saki, and she does not care about anything else."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is aware of his cuteness, and uses it to her advantage to take advantage of others."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16514"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"早紀の幼なじみで、追っかけをしている１年生の少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"傍目からは仲良しに見られているが、実際はありさが一方的に早紀に付いて回っているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"早紀に対して恋愛感情に近いものを持っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"キュートな風貌と仕草で、周りからは妹・マスコット的な扱いを受けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人も自分の可愛らしさは自覚しており、それを活用して他人を自分の都合のいいように利用する腹黒娘。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5692","sourceWorkId":"17251","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"早紀の追っかけをしている1年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"早紀とは幼なじみで小学校からの付き合いがある。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"傍目からは仲良しに見られているが、実際はありさが一方的に早紀に付いて回っているだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"早紀の女性らしいプロポーションや性格に憧れを抱いており、彼女を心の底から慕っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"またそのため、興味のほとんどが早紀に向いており、それ以外のことはあまり意に介さない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"腹黒で、自分のかわいらしさを自覚しており、それを活用して他人を自分の都合のいいように利用する。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63713"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"74 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5692","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5692","sourceWorkId":"17251","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"154 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5692","