"59"},"weight":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a new teacher at the school where the main character works. She is in charge of modern literature and is also the adviser of the literature club."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She went to a famous university, where she met a man and had a relationship with him. She got married right after graduation."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her husband is an elite man working for a major company. She is a loving wife."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a gentle personality, soft-spoken, kind, and friendly."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is loved by her students as if she were their older sister, and is well received by the faculty and staff."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although still inexperienced as a teacher, she has a sincere attitude toward her students, and is nicknamed the \"Holy Mother\" for her kindness in dealing with even the smallest of problems."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c16515"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が働く学園の新人現代文教師で文芸部顧問。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が別の学園で働いていた頃の教え子だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとした性格で物腰が柔らかく、優しく気さく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師としてはまだ未熟だが学生に対しての態度は真摯で、どんな小さな悩み事にも親身になって接するため学生からは慕われ、他の教職員からの評判も良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"美人でスタイルもいいため、大学卒業後すぐに結婚して人妻になったことを惜しむ声も多い。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"5693","sourceWorkId":"17251","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が働く学園の新人教師。担当は現代文で、文芸部の顧問も務めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有名大学に進学し、そこで出会った男性と交際。 卒業後すぐに結婚している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"夫は大手企業に勤めるエリート。愛妻家である。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"おっとりとした性格で物腰が柔らかく、優しくて気さく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学生たちからは歳の近いお姉さんのように慕われ、教職員からの評判も良い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"教師としてはまだ未熟だが、学生に対しての態度は真摯で、どんな小さな悩み事にも親身になって接することから “聖母” とあだ名される。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"63714"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"95 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","source